          "title": "The Lost Bag",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "text": "Mark was very sad. He had left his small bag on the bus this morning. The bag had his wallet and some important papers inside. He did not know how to get it back."
            },
            {
              "text": "His friend, Sam, saw that Mark was upset. Sam told him not to worry and helped him call the bus company. They found out that a driver had found the bag. Now they just needed to go to the office to pick it up."
            },
            {
              "text": "On the way, it started to rain. Sam had an umbrella, a special tool to keep the rain off their clothes, and he held it over both of them. Mark felt lucky to have such a kind friend."
            },
            {
              "text": "When they arrived, the man at the desk gave the bag back to Mark. Mark checked the bag, and everything was still there. He thanked Sam and the bus driver for their help."
            }
          ]
        },
